1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,340
 We show our integrity by living virtuous lives and caring for and serving others.

2
00:00:07,340 --> 00:00:15,100
 The ultimate reward of integrity and virtue is the constant companionship of the Holy Ghost.

3
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:22,200
 The Holy Ghost does not attend us when we do evil, but when we do what is right, he can

4
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:26,920
 dwell with us and guide us in all that we do.

5
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:34,820
 Part of having integrity is acknowledging our faults to the Lord and repenting of transgressions.

6
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:39,980
 When we make repentance a constant day-to-day part of our lives, we can approach the Lord

7
00:00:39,980 --> 00:00:44,100
 with integrity and receive His saving blessings.

8
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:46,200
 And I was a young missionary in the British mission.

